==English==
===Etymology===
Originally solely of Australian usage, from [[Blighty]].
Possibly originated from the Hindoostani word Vilayti which means 'of foreign origin'

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}
#[[Great Britain]], [[Britain]], or [[England]], especially as viewed from abroad

